  "description": "The application proposes a 6 meter rear extension with a flat roof. its also for the conversion of existing garage to a bedroom.\n\n- Ground Floor:\n  - Internal reconfiguration and single-storey rear extension.\n  - New utility room and improved kitchen/dining space.\n\n- First Floor:\n  - Extension to accommodate additional floor space.\n  - Inclusion of new bathroom with obscure glazed window to ensure privacy.\n\n- Roof:\n  - Installation of new GRP flat roof to extension.\n  - Velux skylight (900mm x 900mm) to provide natural light.\n\n- Elevations:\n  - Materials and finishes to match existing, ensuring continuity.\n  - Use of obscure glazing to bathroom and utility windows to protect neighbour amenity.\n",
